Eke
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
CRAIDIL 8 FACE_ALL
CRAIDIL 1 FACE_ALL
CRAIDIL 6 FACE_ALL
CRAIDIL 1 FACE_ALL
CRAIDIL 3 FACE_ALL
CRAIDIL 4 FACE_HALF

AZA 2 FACE_ALL

ZAYE 1 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE ZAYE AZA
AND
    AND
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, CLUBS, HEARTS}
        DEST Empty
    AND
        DEST Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES}
        SRC Rank K
$win
OR
    PILE ALL AZA Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL CRAIDIL Empty
        PILE ALL AZA Empty
